'''Azure Annihilation''' (絶・ブルーインパクト, ''Zetsu・Burū Inpakuto'', '''Absolute - Blue Impact''') is a set of special stages that was added in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]] and appears on the '''13th''', '''14th''', '''27th''', and '''28th''' days of every month. It is unlocked after clearing [[Puffer Planet (Merciless)|Blue Impact]]. The first stage yields 1 million XP when first completed, while the second stage drops the [[True Form]] of [[Mightycat (Rare Cat)|Mightycat]] - Ironcat.

